    "loi_cta": "Two ways to bring a line to your people. Option A \u2014 sponsor a line: your institution underwrites a scheduled service, your name on the hull optional (indicative from ~$125K per month). Option B \u2014 commit seats: reserve seats at $750\u2013900 per seat-month and we aggregate your line's launch. Both start with a non-binding letter of intent: it costs nothing, commits nothing, and tells us which line to build first.",
